// 개인 모드(prefix='')와 궁합 모드 본인/상대(prefix='p1_'/'p2_')가 공유하는 생일·생시 파싱.
function parseBirthAndTime(prefix, showErrorFn) {
  const birthEl = document.getElementById(prefix + 'birth');
  const timeEl = document.getElementById(prefix + 'time');
  const hourUnknownEl = document.getElementById(prefix + 'hourUnknown');
  const ganjiEl = document.getElementById(prefix + 'ganjiSelect');

  const birth = birthEl.value.trim();
  if (!/^\d{8}$/.test(birth)) {
    showErrorFn('생일은 8자리 숫자로 입력해주세요 (예: 19740426)');
    return null;
  }
  const year = parseInt(birth.slice(0, 4), 10);
  const month = parseInt(birth.slice(4, 6), 10);
  const day = parseInt(birth.slice(6, 8), 10);
  if (month < 1 || month > 12 || day < 1 || day > 31) {
    showErrorFn('생일 숫자가 올바르지 않습니다 (예: 19740426)');
    return null;
  }

  const hourUnknown = hourUnknownEl.checked;
  let hour = 0, minute = 0;
  const ganji = ganjiEl.value !== '선택안함' ? ganjiEl.value : '';
  if (!hourUnknown && ganji) {
    [hour, minute] = GANJI_TIME_MAP[ganji];
  } else if (!hourUnknown) {
    const time = timeEl.value.trim();
    if (!/^\d{4}$/.test(time)) {
      showErrorFn('생시는 4자리 숫자로 입력해주세요 (예: 1000), 모르면 "생시모름"을 체크하거나 간지선택을 이용하세요');
      return null;
    }
    hour = parseInt(time.slice(0, 2), 10);
    minute = parseInt(time.slice(2, 4), 10);
    if (hour > 23 || minute > 59) {
      showErrorFn('생시 숫자가 올바르지 않습니다 (00:00~23:59, 예: 1000)');
      return null;
    }
  }

  return { year, month, day, hour, minute, hourUnknown, ganjiSelect: hourUnknown ? '' : ganji };
}

function collectFormData() {
  clearFormError();
  const bt = parseBirthAndTime('', showFormError);
  if (!bt) return null;

  return {
    name: document.getElementById('name').value,
